#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: optionsmodel.cpp:206
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The window property will be only set to the given value after the window is created.\n"
"No further changes will be affected."
msgstr ""
"A propiedade da xanela só se definirá co valor indicado despois de crear a xanela.\n"
"Non afectará a ningún outro cambio."

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: optionsmodel.cpp:209
#, kde-format
